   {
    "id": "GO:0005930",
    "isObsolete": false,
    "name": "axoneme",
    "definition": {
     "text": "The bundle of microtubules and associated proteins that forms the core of cilia (also called flagella) in eukaryotic cells and is responsible for their movements.",
     "xrefs": [
